This GitHub Action distributes pre-compiled binaries and encrypted Q-KineQuant
1.58-Bit model weights (`.kineq`) of the Quimera Mutation Engine.

Execution requires a valid `QUIMERA_LICENSE_KEY` issued by Quimera Laboratory
and cryptographically bound to:
  - Authorized GitHub Organization (`org`)
  - Authorized Repository (`repo`)
  - Authorized Application Code (`app-code`)

Unauthorized redistribution, reverse engineering, or execution outside the
licensed organization, repository, and application scope is prohibited.
